{"id":"226d4e217415a6b5","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-quadgraphrepr.md","title":"Lossless marked graph of a quadratic DNF","display":"df-quadgraphrepr — Lossless marked graph of a quadratic DNF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-quadgraphrepr","aliases":["27-df-quadgraphrepr"],"display":"df-quadgraphrepr — Lossless marked graph of a quadratic DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.4.1–5.4.2","source_statement":"Local marked representation compared against the original graph models","source_printed_pages":"209–211","source_pdf_pages":"233–235","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-quadgraphrepr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-quadgraphrepr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quadgraphrepr — Lossless marked graph of a quadratic DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.4.1–5.4.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Local marked representation compared against the original graph models"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"209–211"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"233–235"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits},T_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits},T_L\\)</span> 取该 DNF 接口的含义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_D\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\mid T\\in D\\land|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|=2\\},\\quad U_D\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid T_{\\{\\ell\\}}\\in D\\},\\quad\\varepsilon_D\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;T_\\varnothing\\in D,\\\\0&amp;T_\\varnothing\\notin D.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_D\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\mid T\\in D\\land|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|=2\\},\\quad U_D\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid T_{\\{\\ell\\}}\\in D\\},\\quad\\varepsilon_D\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;T_\\varnothing\\in D,\\\\0&amp;T_\\varnothing\\notin D.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_D\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D),\\qquad\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)\\coloneqq(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_D\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D),\\qquad\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)\\coloneqq(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本地辅助表示：二次项作为边，一次项作为 marked vertices，空项作为 Boolean flag。旧二元表示在含空项时会丢失信息，现补入 ε_D 后对所有二次 DNF 都可恢复。它不是原书 §5.4.2 的 matched graph；原书还加入互补文字间的 null edges，并用 loops 表示一次项，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"198879e40a0ec5d9\" href=\"?note=198879e40a0ec5d9\" title=\"27-df-matchedgraph\">27-df-matchedgraph</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]]）；$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits},T_L$ 取该 DNF 接口的含义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-matchedgraph","status":"resolved","id":"198879e40a0ec5d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是本地辅助表示：二次项作为边，一次项作为 marked vertices，空项作为 Boolean flag。旧二元表示在含空项时会丢失信息，现补入 ε_D 后对所有二次 DNF 都可恢复。它不是原书 §5.4.2 的 matched graph；原书还加入互补文字间的 null edges，并用 loops 表示一次项，见 [[27-df-matchedgraph]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits},T_L","display":false},{"tex":"E_D\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\mid T\\in D\\land|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|=2\\},\\quad U_D\\coloneqq\\{\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\mid T_{\\{\\ell\\}}\\in D\\},\\quad\\varepsilon_D\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&T_\\varnothing\\in D,\\\\0&T_\\varnothing\\notin D.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"G_D\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D),\\qquad\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)\\coloneqq(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D).","display":true}],"bytes":1773,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-315","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-quadgraphrepr|df-quadgraphrepr — Lossless marked graph of a quadratic DNF]]"},{"id":"4c6ea69877ad9783","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$；$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits}$ 和 $\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)=(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D)$（see [[27-df-quadgraphrepr]]）；$\\mathrm{Clique}(G_D)$（see [[27-df-clique]]）。"},{"id":"9e54deadeb6e055a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$；$\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)=(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D)$ 且 $G_D=(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D)$（see [[27-df-quadgraphrepr]]）。"}],"outgoing":["923be44c9742df37","198879e40a0ec5d9"]}